      <p style="margin:16px 0 0; font-family:'Instrument Sans',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:26px; color:#3A3A37;">Someone tried to create a Unify Compute account with this email address. You already have one, so no new account was created.</p>
